<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Emerging substance alerts | PharmacyNews</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/atlas/style.css"><style>main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:24px}article{border:1px solid #666;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}a{color:#f5ad62}label{display:block;margin:10px 0}input,select,button{font:inherit;padding:8px;max-width:100%}a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cba5f0}dt{font-weight:bold}dd{margin:0 0 10px}</style></head><body><main><a href="/">Back to global monitor</a><h1>Emerging illicit-substance alerts</h1><p>New substances and known drugs of abuse. Official reports describe detections and alerts, not population prevalence. No reports does not mean no harm. Locations are reported areas, not publisher headquarters or patient locations.</p>
<form method="get"><label for="substance">Substance<input id="substance" name="substance" value="<%= query %>"></label><label for="category">Alert category<select id="category" name="category"><option value="">All categories</option><% categories.forEach(c=>{%><option value="<%=c%>" <%= c===category?'selected':'' %>><%=c.replaceAll('_',' ')%></option><%})%></select></label><button type="submit">Filter alerts</button></form>
<p role="status"><%= events.length %> reviewed reports match. No live or comprehensive worldwide surveillance is claimed.</p>
<% if(!events.length){%><article><h2>No reviewed alerts available for this selection</h2><p>Collection and publication are not active. Existing UNODC/EUDA metadata and draft stories are not automatically promoted into geographic events. Unverified event dates and areas must remain unknown.</p></article><%}%>
<% events.forEach(e=>{%><article><h2><%=e.title%></h2><% if(e.stale){%><p role="alert">Source check older than seven days — this may be a superseded alert.</p><%}%><dl><dt>Substance / category</dt><dd><%=e.substance%> / <%=e.category.replaceAll('_',' ')%></dd><dt>Confirmation</dt><dd><%=e.confirmation%></dd><dt>Event / report date</dt><dd><%=e.event_date||'Unknown'%> / <%=e.report_date%></dd><dt>Reported area / precision</dt><dd><%=e.location.name||'Unknown'%> / <%=e.location.precision%></dd><dt>Source checked / editorial review</dt><dd><%=e.checked_at%> / <%=e.reviewed_at%></dd><dt>Uncertainty</dt><dd><%=e.uncertainty%></dd></dl><a href="<%=e.source_url%>" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official source: <%=e.source%></a><p>No substance procurement, preparation or patient-specific treatment instructions.</p></article><%})%></main></body></html>
